WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.090
«I start fired up and stop after three days.»

2
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:07.680
It's not laziness. It's that the next day you no longer remember who you wrote to,

3
00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.190
who owes you a reply,

4
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:13.130
who's waiting for you. With RelAI at 8 there's the morning call:

5
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.890
who to contact today, and the messages already written.

6
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.970
At 1pm a reminder, only if you're behind.

7
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.210
In the evening the day's recap,

8
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.720
with your real numbers.

9
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.260
On Sunday the week's count.

10
00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.980
Never like a drill sergeant.

11
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:28.760
It's not motivation.

12
00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.580
It's rhythm.
